msgid ""
"Play the green light and lead depart chimes even while cruise is engaged\n"
"and holding at a standstill. Without it they only chime while cruise\n"
"is off. Check the road before you go."
msgstr ""
"即使巡航已挂入且在静止等待时，也播放绿灯和前车起步提示音。\n"
"不开启则仅在巡航关闭时响铃。\n"
